    \ justification for disabling it unless one deliberately prefers manual debugging.\n\nTo display this help message again at any time from any room, issue `/execute_action{help research}`.\n\n\n---\n\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1048 | 1 | δ sweep at fixed SOTA topology: δ=0.08 (kd=22, k=50, λ=0.605) | Praxis III | 673 | 0.7429 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.727 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.964 | 0.790 |\n| 1047 | 1 | δ sweep at fixed SOTA topology: δ=0.12 (kd=22, k=50, λ=0.605) | Praxis III | 673 | 0.7414 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248\
    \ | 0.325 | 0.968 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.952 | 0.790 |\n| 1037 | 1 | Probe: DAQB inverse-distance weights on DAQB distances, k=50, kd=22, λ=0.605, δ=0.10 | Praxis III | 669 | 0.6860 | 0.791 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.751 | 1.000 | 0.929 | 0.398 | 0.789 |\n| 1035 | 1 | Probe: DAQB distance-decay weights (Gaussian on DAQB distances), k=50, kd=22, λ=0.605, δ=0.10 | Praxis III | 668 | 0.6809 | 0.792 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.750 | 1.000 | 0.869 | 0.409 | 0.788 |\n| 1026 | 1 | Generalization: Vanilla kNN on MPB‑GraphFWPCA (k=50, binary connectivities) | Praxis III | 664 | 0.6296 | 0.607 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.944 | 0.704 | 1.000 | 0.987 | 0.031 | 0.790 |\n| 1020 | 1 | Masked-weights (row-normalized) using DAQB mask from MPB‑GraphFWPCA (k=50, kd=22, λ=0.605, δ=0.10) | Praxis III | 659 | 0.6626 | 0.626 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.913 | 0.722 | 1.000 | 0.990 | 0.352 | 0.789 |\n| 1019 | 1 | Masked-weights DAQB on MPB‑GraphFWPCA + BRBG: k=50, kd=22 (keep original weights\
