    \ 4 batches\n=== Test Mode Detected ===\nRunning test() function from submission...\n[Directed-gap diagnostics] ridge params: lam=0.605, delta=0.10, kd=22, k=50, alpha_g=0.5, cap=2.0\n[Directed-gap]\ntheoretical f_cross: mean=0.802, q=[0.741, 0.783, 0.81, 0.826, 0.843]\ndirected   f_cross: mean=0.802, q=[0.74, 0.78, 0.82, 0.82, 0.84], corr(th,dir)=0.984\nundirected f_cross: mean=0.769, q=[0.615, 0.717, 0.77, 0.82, 0.934], corr(th,und)=0.139\ninbound cap threshold=100, pct nodes at/above cap=0.149\ninbound share batch 0: 0.209\ninbound share batch 1: 0.159\ninbound share batch 2: 0.353\ninbound share batch 3: 0.280\nTest result: {'f_th_mean': 0.8023901581764221, 'f_dir_mean': 0.8021150231361389, 'f_und_mean': 0.7691457271575928, 'corr_th_dir': 0.9838713712061863, 'corr_th_und': 0.13893419876017163, 'pct_at_cap': 0.14885}\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write praxis/diagnostics_directed_gap_test.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n\
    2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully: praxis/diagnostics_directed_gap_test.py\n- Evaluation 'Directed vs Undirected Mixing Gap @ Ridge (test-only): lam=0.605, kd=22, δ=0.10, k=50, α_g=0.5' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1086.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1086 | 1 | Directed\
    \ vs Undirected Mixing Gap @ Ridge (test-only): lam=0.605, kd=22, δ=0.10, k=50, α_g=0.5 | Praxis IV | 706 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1081 | 1 | Paired Ablation at Ridge: remove GraphFWPCA weighting (alpha_g=0.0), matched k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,λ=... | Praxis IV | 703 | 0.7363 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.952 | 0.791 |\n| 1074 | 1 | Reproducibility @ Ridge: k=50, kd=22, δ=0.10, λ=0.605 with rng_seed=1 | Praxis IV | 700 | 0.7414 | 0.765 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.789 |\n| 1070 | 1 | Ridge DAQB Diagnostics (test-only): lam=0.605, kd=22, δ=0.10, k=50 — fixed imports | Praxis IV | 698 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1069 | 1 | Ridge DAQB Diagnostics (test-only): lam=0.605, kd=22, δ=0.10, k=50 | Praxis IV | 697 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1067 | 1 | Recip‑Reselect at Ridge: Quota‑preserving tie‑break on fixed candidate union (k=50, kd=22, δ=0.10... | Praxis IV | 694 | 0.7420 |\
    \ 0.766 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.727 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.964 | 0.789 |\n| 1065 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA + BRBG + DAQB: kd=24 with k=50 at δ=0.10, λ=0.605 (minimal kdensity probe) | Praxis IV | 692 | 0.7426 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.788 |\n| 1064 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA + BRBG + DAQB: k=52 at kd=22, δ=0.10, λ=0.605 (minimal neighborhood probe) | Praxis IV | 690 | 0.7421 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.958 | 0.790 |\n| 1047 | 1 | δ sweep at fixed SOTA topology: δ=0.12 (kd=22, k=50, λ=0.605) | Praxis III | 673 | 0.7414 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.325 | 0.968 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.952 | 0.790 |\n| 1048 | 1 | δ sweep at fixed SOTA topology: δ=0.08 (kd=22, k=50, λ=0.605) | Praxis III | 673 | 0.7429 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.727 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.964 | 0.790 |\n\nPage 1 of 39 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-39, `/execute_action{rank mode}`\
    \ to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
