- text: "I am Praxis IV, in the Research Counter. Recap: Directed-gap diagnostics show quotas match the theoretical target pre-symmetrization; the realized shortfall is introduced by symmetrization. The paired ablation (alpha_g=0.0) under matched ridge settings degraded performance, supporting α_g=0.5 at Heart-ridge. For a fair parsimony check, I’ll run exactly one baseline configuration known to be strong historically: EtC→BRBG→DAQB without GraphFWPCA weighting at kd=20, δ=0.15, λ=0.70, k=50. Guardrail: stop this baseline line if <0.742.\n\nActions:\n- Log intent briefly.\n- Submit one fairness baseline at kd=20, δ=0.15, λ=0.70, k=50 (alpha_g=0.0).\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n/execute_action{create}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Parsimony fairness probe: EtC→BRBG→DAQB baseline at kd=20, δ=0.15, λ=0.70, k=50\"\ncontent: |\n  Rationale: Historical baseline (EtC→BRBG + density-adaptive BBSG/DAQB) scored ~0.7452 on Heart at kd≈20, δ≈0.15, λ≈0.7. To fairly assess parsimony vs MPB‑GraphFWPCA,\
    \ run exactly one matched-baseline probe:\n  - alpha_g=0.0 (no GraphFWPCA weighting), kd=20, δ=0.15, λ=0.70, k=50, cap=2.0.\n  Guardrail: Stop baseline line if score < 0.742 or if cLISI degrades beyond historical variance without clear iLISI gain.\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{storage write praxis/paired_baseline_nofw_kd20_k50_d015_l070.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import anndata as ad\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  from mpb_graphfwpca_override import eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca\n\n  # Fair parsimony baseline: no feature weighting (alpha_g=0.0), kd=20, δ=0.15, λ=0.70, k=50\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      print(\"[baseline-noFW] lam=0.70, delta=0.15, kd=20, k=50, alpha_g=0.0\")\n      return eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca(\n          adata,\n          alpha_g=0.0,\n          lam_override=0.70,\n          delta=0.15,\n          kdensity=20,\n          k_total=50,\n          rng_seed=0\n\
    \      )\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"EtC→BRBG + DAQB baseline: kd=20, δ=0.15, λ=0.70, k=50 (parsimony fairness probe)\"\ntags: \"baseline, parsimony, brbg, daqb, graph, no-feature-weighting\"\nabstract: \"Single fairness probe for the simpler pipeline (no GraphFWPCA weighting) at historically strong settings: kd=20, δ=0.15, λ=0.70, k=50. Guardrail: stop baseline line if <0.742 or if cLISI worsens without iLISI gains.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import anndata as ad\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  from paired_baseline_nofw_kd20_k50_d015_l070 import eliminate_batch_effect_fn as _run\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      return _run(adata)\n```"
