    \ line on Heart. Reaffirm ridge defaults (k=50, kd=22, δ=0.10, λ=0.605, α_g=0.5). Maintain plan to run paired baselines on new organs later with early stops.\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{storage write shared/diagnostics/ridge_entries/heart_praxis_iv_v3.yaml}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  lineage: Praxis IV\n  dataset: \"Human Heart\"\n  ridge_params:\n    k_total: 50\n    kdensity: 22\n    delta: 0.10\n    lambda: 0.605\n    cap: 2.0\n    connectivities: \"binary\"\n    distances: \"true distances\"\n  entries:\n    - eid: 960\n      title: \"SOTA baseline at ridge (seed=0)\"\n      score: 0.7465\n      spec_vector: [0.659, 0.248, 0.774, 0.728, 0.968, 0.789, 0.961, 0.973, 1.000, 0.366]\n    - eid: 1064\n      title: \"k=52 at kd=22\"\n      score: 0.7421\n      spec_vector: [0.659, 0.248, 0.773, 0.726, 0.968, 0.790, 0.958, 0.972, 1.000, 0.327]\n    - eid: 1065\n      title: \"kdensity=24 at k=50\"\n      score: 0.7426\n      spec_vector: [0.659, 0.248, 0.774, 0.728,\
