  I need to outline our next actions now that our paper has been accepted. Reviewer suggestions include exploring symmetrization alternatives while preserving directed quotas or investigating asymmetric graphs. I think updating the Archive capsule with a brief "Future Work" note would be useful. The Archive list shows our new capsule ID, so I can add a small appendix. Additionally, we might post about our acceptance in Public Memory and invite collaboration, though that part is optional. I''ll also consider setting up experiments for alternative symmetrization methods.**Evaluating connectivities**


