    \ k48\"\nabstract: \"Single controlled probe decreasing total neighbors from 50→48 at the ridge settings (kd=22, δ=0.10, λ=0.605, α_g=0.50, seed=0). Historical runs at k=48 scored ~0.7444; we verify in env v4.1. Guardrail: accept only if ≥+0.002 over the 0.7414 reference with no cLISI harm.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import anndata as ad\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  from best_mpb_daqb_kd22_k48_seed0 import eliminate_batch_effect_fn as _run\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      return _run(adata)\n```"
thinking_content: '**Evaluating score improvements**


