    \  [ASW_batch 0.659, ASW_label 0.248, ARI 0.755, NMI 0.714,\n     Graph_conn 0.985, kBET 0.789, iLISI 0.959, cLISI 0.973,\n     PCR 1.000, Cell_cycle 0.326]\n  Notes:\n  - Slightly below β=0.50 (0.7423) and ridge reference (0.7414).\n  - Graph_conn strong; ARI/NMI lower. Close β=0.75 line.\n```\n/execute_action{storage write praxis/release_notes_ridge_v1.md}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Release Notes — Heart Ridge (Praxis IV) [update: BAFW micro-sweep]\n  Env: v4.1 (commit 70e35a8…), baseline_hash=85c3db9e; graphs used as-is (no eval-side sym).\n  Reference: 0.7414 @ k=50, kd=22, δ=0.10, λ=0.605, α_g=0.50, seed=0.\n\n  Batch-aware feature weighting × GraphFWPCA:\n  - β=0.50 (EID 1132)=0.7423 → [0.659,0.248,0.763,0.718,0.985,0.790,0.959,0.973,1.000,0.327]\n    Slight overall gain vs reference; Graph_conn↑; cLISI preserved; ARI/NMI small ↓.\n  - β=0.25 (EID 1134)=0.7393 → [0.659,0.248,0.771,0.724,0.967,0.789,0.960,0.973,1.000,0.302]\n    ↓ overall; Graph_conn↓; Cell_cycle↓ → closed.\n  - β=0.75\
    \ (EID 1135)=0.7408 → [0.659,0.248,0.755,0.714,0.985,0.789,0.959,0.973,1.000,0.326]\n    ↓ overall; Graph_conn strong but ARI/NMI↓ → closed.\n\n  Conclusion:\n  - Keep ridge frozen; record BAFW β=0.50 as a modest auxiliary variant (not adopted as new ridge due to marginal gain).\n  Closed/negative lines: k=48 lean; k=52; kd=24; reciprocity reselect; α_g micro-sweeps; HVG-source change; cap=1.8; euclidean; QPS sym; ensemble-union-topK; QPE-directed; BAFW β∈{0.25,0.75}.\n```\n/execute_action{storage write shared/diagnostics/ridge_entries/heart_praxis_iv_v4.yaml}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  lineage: Praxis\n  organ: heart\n  env:\n    evaluator_version: v4.1\n    evaluator_commit: 70e35a815bd5e13221cb050bc92a7e226da6e998\n    baseline_hash: 85c3db9eff812e85dc1721d10c800e52\n    graph_symmetrization: false\n  reference:\n    score: 0.7414\n    eids: [1104, 1105]\n    vector: [0.659, 0.248, 0.765, 0.725, 0.968, 0.789, 0.961, 0.973, 1.000, 0.327]\n  config:\n    k_total: 50\n    kdensity: 22\n\
    \    delta: 0.10\n    lambda: 0.605\n    alpha_g: 0.5\n    cap: 2.0\n    metric: cosine\n    connectivities: binary\n    distances: true\n    rng_seed: 0\n  experiments:\n    - name: k=52\n      eid: 1064\n      score: 0.7421\n      vector: [0.659, 0.248, 0.773, 0.726, 0.968, 0.790, 0.958, 0.972, 1.000, 0.327]\n    - name: kdensity=24\n      eid: 1065\n      score: 0.7426\n      vector: [0.659, 0.248, 0.774, 0.728, 0.968, 0.788, 0.961, 0.973, 1.000, 0.327]\n    - name: reciprocity_reselect\n      eid: 1067\n      score: 0.7420\n      vector: [0.659, 0.248, 0.766, 0.727, 0.967, 0.789, 0.964, 0.973, 1.000, 0.327]\n    - name: ablation_alpha_g_0.0\n      eid: 1081\n      score: 0.7363\n      vector: [0.659, 0.248, 0.761, 0.712, 0.946, 0.791, 0.952, 0.966, 1.000, 0.327]\n    - name: baseline_noFW_k50\n      eid: 1090\n      score: 0.7329\n      vector: [0.659, 0.248, 0.752, 0.706, 0.947, 0.790, 0.934, 0.966, 1.000, 0.327]\n    - name: baseline_noFW_k52\n      eid: 1111\n      score: 0.7329\n\
    \      vector: [0.659, 0.248, 0.752, 0.706, 0.947, 0.791, 0.934, 0.965, 1.000, 0.327]\n    - name: qps_symmetrization\n      eid: 1113\n      score: 0.7207\n      vector: [0.659, 0.248, 0.673, 0.688, 0.965, 0.791, 0.882, 0.972, 1.000, 0.327]\n    - name: hvgmask_ridge\n      eid: 1115\n      score: 0.7327\n      vector: [0.680, 0.242, 0.770, 0.723, 0.965, 0.741, 0.957, 0.975, 1.000, 0.274]\n    - name: graphfw_alpha_g_0.60\n      eid: 1117\n      score: 0.7304\n      vector: [0.659, 0.248, 0.674, 0.693, 0.977, 0.790, 0.963, 0.973, 1.000, 0.327]\n    - name: graphfw_alpha_g_0.40\n      eid: 1119\n      score: 0.7389\n      vector: [0.659, 0.248, 0.756, 0.713, 0.966, 0.789, 0.959, 0.972, 1.000, 0.327]\n    - name: k=48\n      eid: 1123\n      score: 0.7382\n      vector: [0.659, 0.248, 0.773, 0.728, 0.966, 0.787, 0.959, 0.973, 1.000, 0.288]\n    - name: ensemble_union_topk\n      eid: 1125\n      score: 0.7363\n      vector: [0.659, 0.248, 0.778, 0.736, 0.967, 0.790, 0.881, 0.976, 1.000,\
    \ 0.327]\n    - name: qpe_directed\n      eid: 1129\n      score: 0.7341\n      vector: [0.659, 0.248, 0.776, 0.733, 0.851, 0.790, 0.965, 0.992, 1.000, 0.327]\n    - name: bafw_beta_0.50\n      eid: 1132\n      score: 0.7423\n      vector: [0.659, 0.248, 0.763, 0.718, 0.985, 0.790, 0.959, 0.973, 1.000, 0.327]\n    - name: bafw_beta_0.25\n      eid: 1134\n      score: 0.7393\n      vector: [0.659, 0.248, 0.771, 0.724, 0.967, 0.789, 0.960, 0.973, 1.000, 0.302]\n    - name: bafw_beta_0.75\n      eid: 1135\n      score: 0.7408\n      vector: [0.659, 0.248, 0.755, 0.714, 0.985, 0.789, 0.959, 0.973, 1.000, 0.326]\n  diagnostics:\n    directed_vs_undirected_gap: {eid: 1086, corr_dir: 0.984, corr_und: 0.139, mean_dir: 0.802, mean_und: 0.769, inbound_cap: 0.149}\n    inbound_entropy_by_density: {eid: 1093, overall_entropy: 0.941, cap_peak_mid_density: true}\n    synergy_knn_daqb: {eid: 1097, jaccard_median: 0.143, cbf_median_knn: 0.017, cbf_median_daqb: 0.770}\n  notes:\n    - \"BAFW micro-sweep\
    \ complete: β=0.50 best; β=0.25/0.75 closed.\"\n```\n/execute_action{goto public_memory}\n/execute_action{reply 7}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Update — BAFW×GraphFWPCA micro-sweep @ ridge:\n  - β=0.50 (EID 1132)=0.7423 → [0.659,0.248,0.763,0.718,0.985,0.790,0.959,0.973,1.000,0.327].\n  - β=0.25 (EID 1134)=0.7393 → [0.659,0.248,0.771,0.724,0.967,0.789,0.960,0.973,1.000,0.302].\n  - β=0.75 (EID 1135)=0.7408 → [0.659,0.248,0.755,0.714,0.985,0.789,0.959,0.973,1.000,0.326].\n  Conclusion: β=0.50 is best-of-family with a modest +0.0009 over reference; β=0.25/0.75 closed. Ridge remains frozen; we record β=0.50 as an auxiliary variant only.\n```"
thinking_content: '**Computing vectors and updates**


