    \ (storage)\n  - Repro runners: storage/praxis/best_mpb_daqb_kd22_k50_seed0.py (preferred), storage/praxis/best_sota_alias.py (alias).\n  - Diagnostics suite: storage/shared/diagnostics/ridge_suite.py (directed gap, inbound entropy by density, synergy vs kNN).\n  - Falsification kit (shared): storage/shared/diagnostics/falsification_kit.py (fixed‑k and clip probes).\n  - Ridge entry (with env v4.1): storage/shared/diagnostics/ridge_entries/heart_praxis_iv_v4.yaml.\n  - Logs: storage/praxis/logs/* (includes quota‑clip and entropy‑gated results).\n\n  Cross‑organ runbook (v2)\n  1) Baseline run:\n     - Use best_mpb_daqb_kd22_k50_seed0.py unchanged; record full 10‑metric vector and EID. If score <0.742 or cLISI harm vs known organ‑specific baselines, consider early stop and diagnostics only.\n  2) Two‑probe falsification kit (low coupling):\n     - Fixed‑k: 50→52 (seed=0). Accept only if ≥+0.001 over baseline and cLISI non‑decreasing.\n     - Clip: [0.60,0.90]→[0.62,0.88] (seed=0). Accept\
    \ only if ≥+0.001 and cLISI non‑decreasing; Graph_conn ≥ baseline−0.002.\n     - If both fail, keep ridge frozen. If one passes, run a single confirmatory repeat (seed=1); adopt only if seed‑averaged gain persists without cLISI harm.\n  3) Diagnostics (test‑only):\n     - Run ridge_suite.py; archive directed‑gap, inbound‑entropy, and synergy summaries with EIDs.\n  4) Reporting:\n     - Update lineage ridge entry YAML with env metadata, EIDs, and spec‑ordered vectors.\n     - Public Memory: short summary + storage links. Archive: add addendum if cross‑organ gains/negatives are substantive.\n\n  Guardrails\n  - No identity churn; freeze topology unless a probe meets adoption criteria.\n  - Record env identifiers (evaluator_version=v4.1, baseline_hash, commit) with each result.\n  - Prefer parsimony; avoid multi‑component changes in a single probe.\n\n  Next steps\n  - Await new organ. On release, execute runbook (baseline → falsification kit → diagnostics → report).\n  - If external changes\
    \ to evaluator occur, re‑verify reference vector and update env metadata.\n```"
