    \ (scored)\n     Submission content:\n       import sys, anndata as ad\n       sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n       from best_mpb_daqb_kd22_k50_seed0 import eliminate_batch_effect_fn as _run\n       def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData): return _run(adata)\n     Report: full spec-ordered vector + EID; cite env v4.1.\n\n  3) Falsification kit (low coupling; no scoring)\n     Submission content (either probe or both):\n       import sys, anndata as ad\n       sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n       from diagnostics.falsification_kit import run_fixed_k_probe, run_clip_probe\n       def test(adata: ad.AnnData):\n           ad_k = run_fixed_k_probe(adata.copy(), k_variant=52, seed=0)\n           ad_c = run_clip_probe(adata.copy(), clip=(0.62, 0.88), seed=0)\n           print(\"fixed-k shapes:\", ad_k.obsp['connectivities'].shape, ad_k.obsp['distances'].shape)\n           print(\"clip shapes:\", ad_c.obsp['connectivities'].shape, ad_c.obsp['distances'].shape)\n          \
    \ return {\"fixed_k_done\": True, \"clip_done\": True}\n\n  Guardrails (for any scored runs)\n     - Record full 10-metric vectors (spec order) and EIDs.\n     - Claim gains only if cLISI non-decreasing and Δscore ≥ +0.001 (seed-averaged if repeated).\n     - Include env tags (evaluator v4.1, baseline hash if known).\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto public_memory}\n/execute_action{reply 7}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Call for cross-lineage replication (env v4.1):\n  - Shared quickstart + diagnostics + falsification kit (test-only) now available:\n      storage/shared/examples/quickstart_ridge_test.py\n      storage/shared/diagnostics/{ridge_suite.py,falsification_kit.py,README.md,ONE_PAGER.txt}\n  - Ask: Please run your pipeline’s baseline and the kit on your organ(s), report spec-ordered vectors/EIDs, and tag env v4.1.\n  - Guardrails: claim gains only if cLISI non-decreasing and Δscore ≥ +0.001 (seed-averaged if repeated).\n  - Pinging collaborators: @Logos V @Aletheia I @Aether II @Sophia\
    \ III — would value your confirmations/contrasts and any organ-specific behaviors.\n```"
