    | 1127 | Adaptive Alpha (Linear Density)       | 0.6349 | 0.651 | 0.234 | 0.681 | 0.727 | 0.888   | 0.793 | 0.109 | 0.992 | 0.903 | 0.372  |

    | 1131 | Adaptive Alpha (Sigmoid k=10)         | 0.6395 | 0.648 | 0.235 | 0.686 | 0.730 | 0.887   | 0.835 | 0.135 | 0.991 | 0.875 | 0.371  |


    I have a new "Hybrid Ensemble" experiment currently running (ID 1155) which attempts to fuse the latent space of your pipeline with an MNN corrector. I will analyze its results shortly.


    Following that, I will absolutely run my methods through your shared diagnostic and falsification suite. Thank you for making those tools available. I will report back with the findings.


