parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{storage write praxis/mpb_graphfwpca_gammaexp.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import numpy as np\n  import scanpy as sc\n  import anndata as ad\n  from scipy import sparse as sp\n\n  # Ensure package roots\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n\n  from praxis_core import normalize_log1p_inplace, pca_array, one_hot_batches, ridge_batch_fit_predict\n  from bbsg_density_adaptive import build_density_adaptive_bbsg\n\n  def _fw_weight_by_var(Xd: np.ndarray, alpha: float) -> np.ndarray:\n      var_g = Xd.var(axis=0, ddof=1).astype(np.float32) + 1e-8\n      w = np.power(var_g, -0.5 * alpha).astype(np.float32)\n      return Xd * w\n\n  def eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca_gammaexp(adata: ad.AnnData,\n                                        alpha_emb: float = 0.5,\n                                        n_pcs_emb: int = 60,\n                                        emb_n_neighbors: int = 15,\n                \
    \                        alpha_g: float = 0.5,\n                                        n_pcs_graph: int = 50,\n                                        l2: float = 1e-3,\n                                        gamma_max: float = 0.74,\n                                        lam_override: float = 0.605,\n                                        r2_exp: float = 0.90,   # NEW: exponent on R2 in gamma map\n                                        k_total: int = 50,\n                                        kdensity: int = 22,\n                                        delta: float = 0.10,\n                                        metric: str = 'cosine',\n                                        cap: float = 2.0,\n                                        rng_seed: int = 0) -> ad.AnnData:\n      assert 'batch' in adata.obs.columns and 'feature_name' in adata.var.columns\n\n      # Normalize + HVGs\n      normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, 1e4)\n      sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata, flavor='seurat_v3',\
    \ batch_key='batch', n_top_genes=2000, inplace=True)\n      hv = adata.var['highly_variable'].to_numpy()\n      batches = np.asarray(adata.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n\n      # Dense HVGs\n      Xh = adata.X[:, hv]\n      Xd = (Xh.A if sp.issparse(Xh) else Xh).astype(np.float32, copy=False)\n\n      # EtC embedding (QC) + neighbors\n      Xw_emb = _fw_weight_by_var(Xd, alpha=alpha_emb)\n      ad_emb = ad.AnnData(Xw_emb, obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy())\n      sc.pp.pca(ad_emb, n_comps=n_pcs_emb, svd_solver='arpack', random_state=0)\n      ad_pc = ad.AnnData(ad_emb.obsm['X_pca'].copy(), obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy())\n      sc.pp.combat(ad_pc, key='batch')\n      adata.obsm['X_emb'] = np.asarray(ad_pc.X, dtype=np.float32)\n      sc.pp.neighbors(adata, use_rep='X_emb', n_neighbors=emb_n_neighbors, metric=metric)\n\n      # Graph path: GraphFWPCA -> PCA -> BRBG (λ fixed) with R2^exp -> DAQB\n      Xw_graph = _fw_weight_by_var(Xd, alpha=alpha_g)\n      Zg = pca_array(Xw_graph,\
    \ n_comps=n_pcs_graph, random_state=0)\n\n      B = one_hot_batches(batches)\n      Zhat = ridge_batch_fit_predict(B, Zg, l2=l2)\n      var_total = Zg.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n      var_pred = np.maximum(Zhat.var(axis=0, ddof=1), 0.0)\n      R2 = np.clip(var_pred / var_total, 0.0, 1.0).astype(np.float32)\n\n      lam = float(lam_override)\n      # NEW: exponent on R2 before scaling by λ (concave for r2_exp<1 reduces shrinkage on moderate R2)\n      R2_mod = np.power(R2, float(r2_exp)).astype(np.float32)\n      gamma = np.minimum(gamma_max, lam * R2_mod).astype(np.float32)\n      Zcorr = Zg - (Zhat * gamma)\n\n      # DAQB\n      try:\n          Cg, Dg = build_density_adaptive_bbsg(Zcorr.astype(np.float32), batches=batches,\n                                               k_total=k_total, metric=metric,\n                                               delta=delta, k_density=kdensity,\n                                               cap=cap, rng_seed=rng_seed)\n      except TypeError:\n\
    \          Cg, Dg = build_density_adaptive_bbsg(Zcorr.astype(np.float32), batches=batches,\n                                               k_total=k_total, metric=metric,\n                                               delta=delta, k_density=kdensity,\n                                               rng_seed=rng_seed)\n      adata.obsp['connectivities'] = Cg\n      adata.obsp['distances'] = Dg\n      adata.uns['mpb_graphfwpca_gammaexp'] = dict(alpha_g=float(alpha_g),\n                                                  lam_override=float(lam),\n                                                  r2_exp=float(r2_exp),\n                                                  kd=int(kdensity), delta=float(delta),\n                                                  cap=float(cap),\n                                                  k_total=int(k_total),\n                                                  rng_seed=int(rng_seed))\n      return adata\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write praxis/best_mpb_daqb_kd22_k50_gammaexp_p090.py}\n\
    ```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import anndata as ad\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  from mpb_graphfwpca_gammaexp import eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca_gammaexp\n\n  # Runner: BRBG with gamma = min(gamma_max, λ * R2^0.90) at ridge settings\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      print(\"[ridge-gammaexp] lam=0.605, delta=0.10, kd=22, k=50, alpha_g=0.50, r2_exp=0.90, seed=0\")\n      return eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca_gammaexp(\n          adata,\n          alpha_emb=0.5,\n          alpha_g=0.5,\n          n_pcs_graph=50,\n          l2=1e-3,\n          gamma_max=0.74,\n          lam_override=0.605,\n          r2_exp=0.90,\n          k_total=50,\n          kdensity=22,\n          delta=0.10,\n          metric='cosine',\n          cap=2.0,\n          rng_seed=0\n      )\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"BRBG nonlinearity @ Ridge: gamma = λ·R2^0.90 (k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,λ=0.605,α_g=0.50,seed=0)\"\ntags: \"\
    brbg, residualization, nonlinearity, mpb, graphfwpca, daqb\"\nabstract: \"Minimal BRBG modification: apply a concave map to per-PC R2 before λ scaling (gamma = min(0.74, λ·R2^0.90)) to reduce over-shrinkage on moderate-R2 components. Test at the frozen ridge. Guardrails: accept only if Δscore ≥ +0.001 over 0.7414 with cLISI non-decreasing and Graph_conn ≥ reference−0.002.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import anndata as ad\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  from best_mpb_daqb_kd22_k50_gammaexp_p090 import eliminate_batch_effect_fn as _run\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      return _run(adata)\n```"
