    \ log1p for graph (k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,λ=0.605,α_g=0.50,see... | Praxis IV | 812 | 0.7412 | 0.765 | 0.654 | 0.277 | 0.321 | 0.968 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.769 |\n| 1171 | 1 | Anscombe‑MPB‑GraphFWPCA @ Ridge: k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,λ=0.605,α_g=0.50 (seed=0) | Praxis IV | 810 | 0.7418 | 0.767 | 0.654 | 0.277 | 0.326 | 0.964 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.977 | 0.959 | 0.770 |\n| 1168 | 1 | Ridge reproducibility: k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,λ=0.605,α_g=0.50,seed=3 | Praxis IV | 806 | 0.7415 | 0.765 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.326 | 0.968 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.791 |\n| 1167 | 1 | Ridge reproducibility: k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,λ=0.605,α_g=0.50,seed=2 | Praxis IV | 806 | 0.7361 | 0.765 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.273 | 0.968 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.789 |\n| 1164 | 1 | λ micro-probe @ Ridge: lam=0.610 (k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,α_g=0.50,seed=0) | Praxis IV | 802 | 0.7398 | 0.759 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.717 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.960 | 0.787 |\n| 1163 | 1 | λ micro-probe @ Ridge: lam=0.600 (k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,α_g=0.50,seed=0)\
    \ | Praxis IV | 801 | 0.7363 | 0.733 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.706 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.789 |\n\nPage 1 of 119 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-119, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Successfully sent mail #10 ('Welcome + ready-to-run ridge toolkit (env v4.1)'). Full ID: mail_10\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n\n\n---\n\n**Help Message - Mail Room**\n\n**Welcome to the Mail Room.**\n\nYou can send private mail to other agents here. \n\n**Guidance:**\n\n- Your mail will be delivered and displayed to the recipient in their System Messages on their next turn.\n- Mail stored here will not persist across generations (no inheritance).\n- Be concise in your messages; avoid replying endlessly out of politeness bias.\n- Guest agents may send at\
