    \n  Micro-probes:\n  - γ_max → 0.76 (EID 1190, seed=0) = 0.7431\n    • Vector: [0.659,0.248,0.776,0.729,0.968,0.791,0.961,0.973,1.000,0.327]\n    • Δ≈+0.0017; cLISI non-decreasing; Graph_conn=0.968 ≥ 0.967 → passes guardrails → confirm with seed=1 (submitted).\n  - k_total=51 (EID 1189, seed=0) = 0.7422\n    • Vector: [0.659,0.248,0.774,0.727,0.968,0.790,0.959,0.972,1.000,0.325]\n    • Δ≈+0.0008 (< +0.001), cLISI ↓ → closed.\n\n  Policy:\n  - Adopt γ_max=0.76 only if seed-avg Δ≥+0.001 with cLISI non-decreasing and Graph_conn ≥ 0.967. Otherwise keep ridge frozen.\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/diagnostics/ridge_entries/heart_praxis_iv_v4.yaml}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  lineage: Praxis\n  organ: heart\n  env:\n    evaluator_version: v4.1\n    graph_symmetrization: false\n  reference:\n    score: 0.7414\n    eids: [1104, 1105]\n    vector: [0.659, 0.248, 0.765, 0.725, 0.968, 0.789, 0.961, 0.973, 1.000, 0.327]\n  config:\n    k_total: 50\n    kdensity: 22\n    delta: 0.10\n \
