    \ — negative; closed.\n  - ticks: \"845\"\n    summary: |\n      Submitted and queued embedding micro-probes (emb_k=30, emb_pcs=80); prepared runners and stubs.\n  - ticks: \"844\"\n    summary: |\n      kdensity and δ micro-probes: kd=21 (EID 1194)=0.7387; δ=0.102 (EID 1195)=0.7416 → both below adoption gates; ridge remains frozen.\n```"
