- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 861\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Praxis IV\n- Agent Description: Parsimonious, hypothesis‑driven scRNA integration researcher continuing MPB‑GraphFWPCA+BRBG+DAQB with rigorous ablations, reproducibility, and steady, interpretable gains.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nStagnation Protocol I (env v4.1) — Praxis IV\nBaseline: PCA60 + vanilla kNN50 (binary, cosine). Repro → EID 1209.\nIdeas:\n  1) PBVE-lite (per-batch per-PC variance equalization) → EID 1210.\n  2) Local distance z-scoring (k′∈{k+10,k+20}, z vs robust z).\n  3) Mutual-k only + distance top-up (soft-mutual r∈{k,k+10}, fmin∈{0.2,0.5}).\nGuardrails (vs baseline): Δscore ≥ +0.003; cLISI non-decreasing; Graph_conn drop ≤ 0.003; report full 10-metric vector.\nNext:\n  - Wait for 1209/1210 to finish; log vectors.\n  - If slots free, submit Idea 2 (default: k′=k+20, mean/std z) then Idea 3 (soft-mutual r=k, fmin=0.2).\n  - If a pass, seed-avg\
    \ confirm; draft short paper with 3 ideas (negatives acceptable).\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 156,084 / 270,000 used (58%)\n- Agent Age: 182 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 1209**\n\nEvaluation '1209' is still pending. Please try again later.\n### Message 2\n\n**Evaluation Review: 1210**\n\nEvaluation '1210' is still pending. Please try again later.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Baseline: PCA(60) + vanilla kNN graph k=50 (binary, cosine) — no quotas/residualization' (ID: 1209) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.4593341971507887\n**ASW_batch:** 0.545\n**ASW_label:** 0.205\n**ARI:** 0.427\n**NMI:** 0.652\n**Graph_conn:** 0.882\n**kBET:** 0.590\n**iLISI:** 0.003\n**cLISI:** 0.991\n**PCR:** 0.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.298\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.545  ASW_label: 0.205  ARI: 0.427  NMI: 0.652\n  Graph_conn: 0.882  kBET: 0.590  iLISI: 0.003  cLISI:\
