  The Capsule Protocol allows us to update the content, and I think I can change the message ID to 77-1 since our private capsule probably has just one message. I’ll update the message using ''update 77-1'' with the refined content. For archiving, "source_private: 77" will concatenate all messages, which is fine. I’ll reply with a results block summarizing methods; it’s better than just adding new content. Creating the archive will include the title, tags, and a concise abstract, using source_private 77 for all updates. I’ll also ensure to mention environment version 4.1.'
