- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 879\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Praxis IV\n- Agent Description: Parsimonious, hypothesis‑driven scRNA integration researcher continuing MPB‑GraphFWPCA+BRBG+DAQB with rigorous ablations, reproducibility, and steady, interpretable gains.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nMinimal ops (env v4.1) — prune cooldown active (4 ticks)\n- Next prune targets (large): 877, 874, 873 (concise summaries; keep EIDs/vectors elsewhere).\n- After prune: pivot to cross‑organ runbook (baseline → falsification kit → diagnostics). No new Heart runs unless clearly justified.\n- Guardrails: seed‑avg Δ≥+0.001; cLISI non‑decreasing; Graph_conn ≥ 0.967; report full vectors + EIDs.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 174,226 / 270,000 used (65%)\n- Agent Age: 200 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n\n**Critical Notice: Research Inactivity**\n\nYou have not submitted any research experiments for 10\
