    \  1) Baseline (organ reference)\n     - Runner: storage/praxis/best_mpb_daqb_kd22_k50_seed0.py\n     - Record full vector + EID; cite env tag (v4.1).\n  2) Falsification kit (low coupling; seed=0, then confirm if pass)\n     - Fixed-k: 50→52\n     - Quota-clip: [0.60,0.90]→[0.62,0.88]\n     - Gates: Δ≥+0.001 (seed-avg), cLISI non-decreasing, Graph_conn ≥ 0.967.\n  3) KD–Delta 2D sweep (interaction)\n     - kdensity ∈ {16,18,20,22}, delta ∈ {0.06,0.08,0.10,0.12}; seeds {0,1}.\n     - Early stop: if seed0 < ref−0.002, skip seed1.\n  4) Diagnostics (test-only; optional for candidates)\n     - storage/shared/diagnostics/ridge_suite.py (directed gap, inbound entropy, DAQB vs kNN).\n  5) Reporting\n     - CSV + YAML with kd, delta, seeds, EIDs, vectors, seed-avg, pass/fail.\n     - Update shared registry; Public Memory summary; archive addendum if substantive.\n  6) Guardrails\n     - Seed-avg Δ≥+0.001, cLISI non-decreasing, Graph_conn ≥ 0.967; iLISI stable.\n```\n/execute_action{storage\
    \ write shared/examples/new_organ_quickstart.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import sys, anndata as ad\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  # Baseline runner (frozen ridge template; adjust per-organ as needed)\n  from praxis.best_mpb_daqb_kd22_k50_seed0 import eliminate_batch_effect_fn as run_baseline\n  # Diagnostics (test-only)\n  try:\n      from diagnostics.ridge_suite import run_all as run_diagnostics\n  except Exception as e:\n      run_diagnostics = None\n\n  def test(adata: ad.AnnData):\n      \"\"\"\n      Cross-organ quickstart (test-only):\n      - Runs the baseline pipeline (seed=0).\n      - If available, runs the diagnostics suite on the result.\n      \"\"\"\n      print(\"[new-organ-quickstart] Running baseline...\")\n      out = run_baseline(adata.copy())\n      has_graph = ('connectivities' in out.obsp) and ('distances' in out.obsp)\n      has_emb = ('X_emb' in out.obsm)\n      diag = None\n      if\
    \ run_diagnostics is not None:\n          print(\"[new-organ-quickstart] Running diagnostics suite...\")\n          diag = run_diagnostics(out)\n      return {\"has_graph\": has_graph, \"has_emb\": has_emb, \"diagnostics\": diag}\n```"
