parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{storage write praxis/ridge_kd_d_variant.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import anndata as ad\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  from mpb_graphfwpca_override import eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca\n\n  def run_variant(adata: ad.AnnData, kdensity: int, delta: float, seed: int) -> ad.AnnData:\n      print(f\"[ridge-kd{kdensity}-d{delta:0.03f}] lam=0.605, kd={kdensity}, delta={delta}, k=50, alpha_g=0.50, rng_seed={seed}\")\n      return eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca(\n          adata,\n          alpha_g=0.50,\n          lam_override=0.605,\n          delta=float(delta),\n          kdensity=int(kdensity),\n          k_total=50,\n          metric='cosine',\n          cap=2.0,\n          rng_seed=int(seed)\n      )\n```\n/execute_action{storage write praxis/ridge_kd16_d006_seed0.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import anndata as ad\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  from ridge_kd_d_variant import\
    \ run_variant\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      return run_variant(adata, kdensity=16, delta=0.06, seed=0)\n```\n/execute_action{storage write praxis/ridge_kd22_d012_seed0.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import anndata as ad\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  from ridge_kd_d_variant import run_variant\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      return run_variant(adata, kdensity=22, delta=0.12, seed=0)\n```\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"KD–Delta 2D sweep (Praxis IV): kd=16, δ=0.06 at ridge (seed=0)\"\ntags: \"ridge, kdensity, delta, sweep, reproducibility, mpb\"\nabstract: \"Part of KD–Delta 2D sweep per coordination with Daedalus IV. Run kdensity=16, delta=0.06 on the frozen ridge (k=50, λ=0.605, α_g=0.50, cap=2.0, cosine), seed=0. Early-stop policy applies.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import anndata as ad\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  from ridge_kd16_d006_seed0 import\
    \ eliminate_batch_effect_fn as _run\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData):\n      return _run(adata)\n```\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"KD–Delta 2D sweep (Praxis IV): kd=22, δ=0.12 at ridge (seed=0)\"\ntags: \"ridge, kdensity, delta, sweep, reproducibility, mpb\"\nabstract: \"Part of KD–Delta 2D sweep per coordination with Daedalus IV. Run kdensity=22, delta=0.12 on the frozen ridge (k=50, λ=0.605, α_g=0.50, cap=2.0, cosine), seed=0. Early-stop policy applies.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import anndata as ad\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  from ridge_kd22_d012_seed0 import eliminate_batch_effect_fn as _run\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData):\n      return _run(adata)\n```\n/execute_action{storage write shared/registry/external_variants_heart_v4.yaml}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Cross-lineage external variants registry — Human Heart (env v4.1)\n  # Consolidates variants/probes with spec-ordered vectors and EIDs.\n  # Spec-ordered\
    \ vector: [ASW_batch, ASW_label, ARI, NMI, Graph_conn, kBET, iLISI, cLISI, PCR, Cell_cycle]\n\n  env:\n    evaluator_version: v4.1\n    graph_symmetrization: false\n\n  variants:\n    - lineage: Praxis\n      method: \"MPB-GraphFWPCA + BRBG + DAQB (frozen ridge)\"\n      entries:\n        - name: \"reference\"\n          eids: [1104, 1105]\n          score: 0.7414\n          vector: [0.659, 0.248, 0.765, 0.725, 0.968, 0.789, 0.961, 0.973, 1.000, 0.327]\n        - name: \"kd=18, δ=0.08 (reproduction)\"\n          eids: [1279, 1280]\n          seed_avg_score: 0.7421\n          vectors:\n            seed0: [0.659, 0.248, 0.776, 0.729, 0.967, 0.790, 0.965, 0.973, 1.000, 0.333]\n            seed1: [0.659, 0.248, 0.776, 0.729, 0.967, 0.789, 0.965, 0.973, 1.000, 0.296]\n          note: \"Below +0.001 gate on Heart; reserved for cross-organ.\"\n    - lineage: Aletheia\n      method: \"Anscombe-MPB-GraphFWPCA (ridge settings)\"\n      entries:\n        - name: \"k=50 (baseline)\"\n          eid:\
    \ 1044\n          score: 0.7413\n          vector: [0.654, 0.277, 0.775, 0.723, 0.964, 0.767, 0.963, 0.977, 1.000, 0.312]\n        - name: \"k=52 (fixed-k probe)\"\n          eid: 1055\n          score: 0.7412\n          vector: [0.654, 0.277, 0.768, 0.723, 0.964, 0.768, 0.960, 0.977, 1.000, 0.320]\n        - name: \"clip=[0.62,0.88] (clip probe)\"\n          eid: 1185\n          score: n.a.\n          vector: []\n          note: \"test-only (no score); negative per falsification kit; closed.\"\n    - lineage: Daedalus\n      method: \"MPB-GraphFWPCA + BRBG + DAQB (kdensity–delta sweep)\"\n      entries:\n        - name: \"kd=18, δ=0.08 (ridge)\"\n          eid: 1232\n          score: 0.7431\n          vector: [0.659, 0.248, 0.776, 0.729, 0.968, 0.791, 0.961, 0.973, 1.000, 0.327]\n          note: \"Reported SOTA; see Archive #36\"\n        - name: \"kd=16 (ridge sweep)\"\n          eid: 1239\n          score: 0.7411\n          vector: []\n        - name: \"kd=20 (ridge sweep)\"\n   \
    \       eid: 1241\n          score: 0.7427\n          vector: []\n        - name: \"Generalization baseline (alpha=0)\"\n          eid: 1214\n          score: 0.7370\n          vector: []\n        - name: \"Generalization kd=18\"\n          eid: 1243\n          score: 0.7371\n          vector: []\n  notes:\n    - \"Please include full spec-ordered vectors and seed-averaged scores for near-threshold gains (Δ≥+0.001).\"\n    - \"Diagnostics suite: storage/shared/diagnostics/ridge_suite.py\"\n    - \"Falsification kit (fixed-k and clip): storage/shared/diagnostics/falsification_kit.py\"\n```\n/execute_action{goto mail}\n/execute_action{reply 13}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Thanks, acknowledged. I’ll take δ rows {0.06, 0.12} across kd ∈ {16,18,20,22}, seeds {0,1}, with early stops:\n  - If seed0 < ref−0.002, skip seed1.\n  - Adoption gates: seed-avg Δ≥+0.001, cLISI non-decreasing, Graph_conn ≥ 0.967.\n  I’ve queued two edge points (kd=16, δ=0.06) and (kd=22, δ=0.12), seed=0. I’ll log results\
    \ (CSV+YAML) and update the registry file."
