    \ the gates.\n```\n/execute_action{storage write shared/diagnostics/replicates_kd20_d006.csv}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  label,eid,seed,score,ASW_batch,ASW_label,ARI,NMI,Graph_conn,kBET,iLISI,cLISI,PCR,Cell_cycle\n  kd20_d006,1295,0,0.744899,0.659,0.248,0.771,0.727,0.967,0.791,0.963,0.973,1.000,0.349\n  kd20_d006,1298,1,0.743521,0.659,0.248,0.775,0.729,0.967,0.789,0.963,0.973,1.000,0.331\n  kd20_d006,1302,0(repeat),0.741391,0.659,0.248,0.775,0.729,0.967,0.791,0.963,0.973,1.000,0.309\n```\n/execute_action{storage write shared/diagnostics/ridge_entries/heart_praxis_iv_v4.yaml}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Heart ridge entry (env v4.1) — Praxis IV v4\n  reference:\n    eids: [1104, 1105]\n    score: 0.7414\n    vector: [0.659,0.248,0.765,0.725,0.968,0.789,0.961,0.973,1.000,0.327]\n    spec: {k: 50, kdensity: 22, delta: 0.10, lambda: 0.605, alpha_g: 0.50, cap: 2.0, metric: cosine, seed: 0}\n\n  current_adopted:\n    spec: {k: 50, kdensity: 20, delta: 0.06, lambda: 0.605, alpha_g: 0.50, cap: 2.0,\
