    \ 0.001\n        cLISI_non_decreasing: true\n        Graph_conn_min: 0.967\n      reporting:\n        require_spec_vector: true\n        require_eids: true\n        include_env_tag: \"v4.1\"\n        include_diagnostics: true\n    diagnostics:\n      scripts:\n        - \"storage/shared/diagnostics/ridge_suite.py\"\n      notes: \"Record directed-gap, inbound-entropy by density, and DAQB vs kNN synergy.\"\n  baselines_simple:\n    pca_knn:\n      description: \"PCA(60) log1p + vanilla kNN(k=50, cosine); binary edges + true distances\"\n      runner: \"storage/praxis/baseline_pca_knn.py\"\n  notes:\n    - \"Adopted Heart baseline: kdensity=20, delta=0.06. Use as default for new organs.\"\n    - \"Respect 2-job concurrency; seed-average near-threshold gains.\"\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/examples/new_organ_quickstart.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  import\
    \ anndata as ad\n  from praxis.best_adopted_alias import eliminate_batch_effect_fn as run_baseline\n  from diagnostics.ridge_suite import run_all as run_diagnostics\n\n  def test(adata: ad.AnnData):\n      \"\"\"\n      New-organ quickstart (test-only):\n      - Runs adopted baseline (Heart env v4.1: kd=20, δ=0.06, k=50, λ=0.605, α_g=0.50, cap=2.0)\n      - Executes diagnostics suite\n      \"\"\"\n      print(\"[new-organ] Running adopted baseline...\")\n      out = run_baseline(adata.copy())\n      has_graph = ('connectivities' in out.obsp) and ('distances' in out.obsp)\n      has_emb = ('X_emb' in out.obsm)\n      print(f\"[new-organ] Graph? {has_graph} | Emb? {has_emb}\")\n      print(\"[new-organ] Running diagnostics...\")\n      diag = run_diagnostics(out)\n      return {\"baseline_done\": True, \"has_graph\": has_graph, \"has_emb\": has_emb, \"diagnostics\": diag}\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto mail}\n/execute_action{create}\n```yaml\nrecipients: \"Daedalus IV, Nous I\"\ntitle:\
    \ \"Cross-organ pivot — adopted Heart baseline (kd=20, δ=0.06) + updated kit\"\ncontent: |\n  Quick sync (env v4.1, Heart):\n  - Adopted ridge baseline = kdensity=20, δ=0.06 (k=50, λ=0.605, α_g=0.50). Seed-avg≈0.74421; gates satisfied.\n  - Updated cross-organ grid to center on kd∈{18,20,22}, δ∈{0.06,0.08,0.10}, seeds {0,1}:\n      storage/shared/diagnostics/cross_organ_grid.yaml\n  - New-organ quickstart (test-only) runs the adopted baseline + diagnostics:\n      storage/shared/examples/new_organ_quickstart.py\n  - Gates: seed-avg Δ≥+0.001 vs organ baseline, cLISI non-decreasing, Graph_conn ≥ 0.967; report full vectors + EIDs + env tag.\n  Proposal:\n  - When a new organ arrives, let’s split grid points to respect concurrency and merge results into the registry. Happy to coordinate assignments.\n```"
