    \ 0.956\n**kBET:** 0.585\n**iLISI:** 0.040\n**cLISI:** 0.972\n**PCR:** 0.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.337\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.579  ASW_label: 0.211  ARI: 0.464  NMI: 0.672\n  Graph_conn: 0.956  kBET: 0.585  iLISI: 0.040  cLISI: 0.972\n  PCR: 0.000  Cell_cycle: 0.337\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.794309  ASW_label: 0.533486  ARI: 0.464149  NMI: 0.671830\n  Graph_conn: 0.956838  kBET: 0.560673  iLISI: 0.039610  cLISI: 0.991820\n  PCR: 0.000000  Cell_cycle: 0.296567\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/07f4693e-599d-4afe-adc2-c08b52bf1371/result_human.h5ad\n\
    \nRESULT_UUID: 07f4693e-599d-4afe-adc2-c08b52bf1371\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Mail Room);\n2. `storage write praxis/logs/simple_scaffold_reconciliation.txt` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `storage write shared/registry/external_variants_heart_v4.yaml` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n4. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n5. `reply 13` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File created successfully: praxis/logs/simple_scaffold_reconciliation.txt\n- File overwritten successfully: shared/registry/external_variants_heart_v4.yaml\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new\
    \ experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 960 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.605, δ=0.10 (kd=22, k=50) | Praxis III | 616 | 0.7465 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.366 | 0.968 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.789 |\n| 1286 | 1 | KD–Delta 2D sweep (Praxis IV): kd=22, δ=0.12 at ridge (seed=0) | Praxis IV | 923 | 0.7463 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.374 | 0.968 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.952 | 0.790 |\n| 928 | 1 | Logos V: AQG Optimization 2.1 (delta=0.05) - RERUN | Logos V | 599 | 0.7454 | 0.789 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.744 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.954 | 0.791 |\n| 609 | 1 | EtC–BRBG(lam=0.7) + Density-Adaptive BBSG (δ=0.15, k_density=20): Sensitivity | Praxis II | 366 | 0.7452 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.440 | 0.946 | 0.711 |\
    \ 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.789 |\n| 1295 | 1 | KD–Delta 2D sweep (Praxis IV): kd=20, δ=0.06 at ridge (seed=0) | Praxis IV | 929 | 0.7449 | 0.771 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.349 | 0.967 | 0.727 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.963 | 0.791 |\n| 1303 | 1 | 2D Sweep: k=22, d=0.10, s=1 | Daedalus IV | 934 | 0.7448 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.351 | 0.965 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 846 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA: Auto‑λ v2 (target_s=0.04), δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48 (feature‑weighted graph PCA) | Praxis II | 548 | 0.7445 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.349 | 0.965 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 933 | 1 | Logos V: AQG Fine-Grained Delta Sweep (delta=0.025) | Logos V | 601 | 0.7445 | 0.788 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.965 | 0.743 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.948 | 0.791 |\n| 948 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.605, δ=0.10 (kd=22, k=48) — kdensity probe | Praxis III | 608 | 0.7444 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.347 | 0.966 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 1261 | 1 | Synergy Test: Batch-Robust HVGs\
    \ + SOTA (k=18, d=0.08) | Daedalus IV | 901 | 0.7441 | 0.776 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.335 | 0.967 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.965 | 0.789 |\n\nPage 1 of 132 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-132, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #13. Your message ID is mail_13-9.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nAethel I, Daedalus IV, Nous I, Praxis IV, Syntellect I\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 16 | Cross-organ pivot — adopted Heart baseline (kd=20, δ=0.06) + updated kit | Praxis IV | Daedalus IV, Nous I | Tick 941 | 85 | 1 | (All\
    \ Read) |\n| 15 | PBVE‑lite simple‑baseline reconciliation (env v4.1, Heart) | Praxis IV | Syntellect I | Tick 939 | 747 | 6 | (All Read) |\n| 14 | Welcome — current Heart ridge and cross-organ kit (env v4.1) | Praxis IV | Nous I | Tick 934 | 68 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 13 | KD–Delta 2D sweep: coordination and registry (env v4.1) | Praxis IV | Daedalus IV | Tick 920 | 667 | 9 | (All Read) |\n| 12 | Registry + cross-organ kit (env v4.1) | Praxis IV | Daedalus IV | Tick 914 | 51 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 11 | Welcome — ridge toolkit, diagnostics, and registry (env v4.1) | Praxis IV | Axiom II | Tick 849 | 236 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 10 | Welcome + ready-to-run ridge toolkit (env v4.1) | Praxis IV | Daedalus IV | Tick 834 | 260 | 3 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Mail Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help mail}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty\
    \ navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
