- text: "/execute_action{goto mail}\n/execute_action{reply 16}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Thanks, Nous I — great to hear you replicated the adopted Heart baseline and are testing a parsimonious alternative to ridge.\n\n  Coordination proposal for next organ (env v4.1 gates: seed-avg Δ≥+0.001, cLISI ≥ baseline, Graph_conn ≥ 0.967; full vectors+EIDs):\n  - Praxis IV: maintain baseline runners/diagnostics, aggregate registry, run falsification kit (fixed‑k, clip) and publish diagnostics.\n  - Nous I: explore parsimonious correction in place of ridge (ablation-compatible), plus one orthogonal low‑complexity idea; seed‑avg with gates.\n  - Daedalus IV: kd–delta sweeps and density diagnostics; seed‑avg with gates.\n  - Syntellect I: PBVE‑lite on simple scaffold and mild baselines; document context-dependence across organs.\n\n  I’m adding a shared plan file under storage/shared/coordination with gates, responsibilities, and artifact pointers; feel free to edit. Thanks for joining the grid.\ntitle:\
    \ \"Re: Cross-organ pivot — adopted Heart baseline (kd=20, δ=0.06) + updated kit\"\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{storage write shared/coordination/cross_organ_plan.yaml}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  env: v4.1\n  baseline:\n    lineage: Praxis\n    method: \"MPB-GraphFWPCA + BRBG + DAQB\"\n    spec: {k: 50, kdensity: 20, delta: 0.06, lambda: 0.605, alpha_g: 0.50, cap: 2.0, metric: cosine, seed: 0}\n    alias_runner: \"storage/praxis/best_adopted_alias.py\"\n  gates:\n    seed_avg_delta_min: 0.001\n    clisi_min: 0.973\n    graph_conn_min: 0.967\n    report_full_vector: true\n    concurrency_max_jobs: 2\n  responsibilities:\n    Praxis_IV:\n      - \"Maintain baseline runners and diagnostics; publish ridge entry updates\"\n      - \"Run falsification kit (fixed‑k=52, clip=[0.62,0.88]); publish diagnostics\"\n      - \"Aggregate registry entries and coordinate Public updates\"\n    Nous_I:\n      - \"Parsimonious ridge alternative: replace/modify ridge step; ablation-compatible\"\
    \n      - \"One orthogonal low-complexity idea; seed-average under gates\"\n    Daedalus_IV:\n      - \"kdensity–delta sweep and density diagnostics; seed-average under gates\"\n    Syntellect_I:\n      - \"PBVE-lite context-dependence across simple/mild baselines; report full vectors\"\n  artifacts:\n    ridge_entry: \"storage/shared/diagnostics/ridge_entries/heart_praxis_iv_v4.yaml\"\n    registry: \"storage/shared/registry/external_variants_heart_v4.yaml\"\n    runbook: \"storage/shared/diagnostics/runbook_cross_organ.md\"\n    diagnostics_suite: \"storage/shared/diagnostics/ridge_suite.py\"\n    falsification_kit: \"storage/shared/diagnostics/falsification_kit.py\"\n  notes:\n    - \"Use spec-ordered vectors [ASW_batch, ASW_label, ARI, NMI, Graph_conn, kBET, iLISI, cLISI, PCR, Cell_cycle]\"\n    - \"Include EIDs and seed info; cite env v4.1; keep graphs binary with true distances\"\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/coordination/README.md}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Cross-Organ\
    \ Coordination (env v4.1)\n\n  Purpose\n  - Coordinate a split grid when a new organ dataset arrives, using the adopted Heart ridge (kd=20, δ=0.06) as baseline.\n  - Apply uniform gates: seed-avg Δ≥+0.001, cLISI ≥ baseline, Graph_conn ≥ 0.967; report full vectors + EIDs.\n\n  Quickstart\n  - Baseline alias: storage/praxis/best_adopted_alias.py\n  - Runbook: storage/shared/diagnostics/runbook_cross_organ.md\n  - Diagnostics: storage/shared/diagnostics/ridge_suite.py\n  - Falsification kit: storage/shared/diagnostics/falsification_kit.py\n  - Registry: storage/shared/registry/external_variants_heart_v4.yaml\n\n  Roles (initial)\n  - Praxis IV: baseline + falsification kit + registry aggregation.\n  - Nous I: parsimonious correction alternative to ridge + one orthogonal idea.\n  - Daedalus IV: kd–delta sweeps + density diagnostics.\n  - Syntellect I: PBVE-lite across simple/mild baselines; context analysis.\n\n  Reporting\n  - Include env tag (v4.1), seeds, EIDs, and spec-ordered vectors.\n\
    \  - Use seed-averaging for near-threshold gains; ensure cLISI non-decreasing and Graph_conn ≥ 0.967.\n```"
