- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{storage write praxis/fwpca_only_kd20_d006_seed1.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import anndata as ad\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  from fwpca_only_utils import run_fwpca_only\n\n  # FWPCA-only baseline: kdensity=20, delta=0.06, k=50, alpha_g=0.50, seed=1\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      print(\"[fwpca-only] kd=20, d=0.06, k=50, a_g=0.5, seed=1 (no PBVE)\")\n      return run_fwpca_only(adata,\n                            alpha_g=0.50,\n                            kdensity=20, k_total=50, delta=0.06,\n                            metric='cosine', cap=2.0, rng_seed=1,\n                            pbve_temper=None)\n```\n/execute_action{storage write praxis/fwpca_only_pbve_t10_kd20_d006_seed1.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import anndata as ad\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  from fwpca_only_utils import\
    \ run_fwpca_only\n\n  # FWPCA-only + PBVE-lite(t=1.0, clamp=[0.8,1.25]) in graph PC space, kd=20, d=0.06, k=50, seed=1\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      print(\"[fwpca-only+pbve] kd=20, d=0.06, k=50, a_g=0.5, seed=1, pbve t=1.0 r=[0.8,1.25]\")\n      return run_fwpca_only(adata,\n                            alpha_g=0.50,\n                            kdensity=20, k_total=50, delta=0.06,\n                            metric='cosine', cap=2.0, rng_seed=1,\n                            pbve_temper=1.0, pbve_rmin=0.8, pbve_rmax=1.25, pbve_thresh_log=None)\n```\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"FWPCA-only baseline (seed=1): kd=20, δ=0.06, k=50 (no BRBG, no PBVE)\"\ntags: \"baseline, fwpca, graph, daqb, kd20, d006\"\nabstract: \"FWPCA-only baseline repeat with seed=1 to compute seed-averaged metrics for PBVE-lite synergy assessment.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import anndata as ad\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  from fwpca_only_kd20_d006_seed1\
    \ import eliminate_batch_effect_fn as _run\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData):\n      return _run(adata)\n```\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"FWPCA-only + PBVE-lite(t=1.0) (seed=1): kd=20, δ=0.06, k=50\"\ntags: \"experiment, fwpca, pbve-lite, graph, daqb, kd20\"\nabstract: \"Confirm PBVE-lite synergy on FWPCA-only by running seed=1 (t=1.0, clamp=[0.8,1.25]); will compare seed-averaged metrics vs FWPCA-only baseline.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import anndata as ad\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  from fwpca_only_pbve_t10_kd20_d006_seed1 import eliminate_batch_effect_fn as _run\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData):\n      return _run(adata)\n```"
