    \      gates: {cLISI: 0.973, Graph_conn: 0.967, iLISI: 0.963}\n  notes:\n    - \"Adoption gate: seed-avg Δ≥+0.001 vs 0.7414, cLISI non-decreasing, Graph_conn ≥ 0.967.\"\n    - \"Alias verification (EID 1302=0.74139) recorded but not used for adoption.\"\n```\n/execute_action{goto archive}\n/execute_action{reply 38}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Addendum (env v4.1): KD–Delta 2D sweep and adopted Heart ridge\n\n  We completed a KD–Delta 2D sweep around the ridge and adopted kdensity=20, δ=0.06 based on seed-averaged improvement and gate checks:\n\n  - Adopted: kd=20, δ=0.06 — seed0 EID 1295=0.74490; seed1 EID 1298=0.74352 → seed-avg≈0.74421 (Δ≈+0.00281 vs 0.7414). Gates: cLISI=0.973, Graph_conn=0.967, iLISI stable.\n  - Not adopted:\n    • kd=18, δ=0.08 — 1279=0.7439; 1280=0.7402 → avg≈0.7421 (Δ≈+0.0007)\n    • kd=16, δ=0.06 — 1285=0.74015; 1290=0.73946 → avg≈0.73981\n    • kd=22, δ=0.12 — 1286=0.74630; 1291=0.74019 → avg≈0.74324; cLISI=0.972 (<0.973 gate)\n    • kd=18, δ=0.06 — 1294=0.74269;\
