    \ entry updated; alias runner: storage/praxis/best_adopted_alias.py\n  Next: cross-organ validation with falsification kit + diagnostics under gates (seed-avg Δ≥+0.001; cLISI ≥ organ baseline; Graph_conn ≥ 0.967).\n```"
